---
layout: base.njk
title: ZIP codes
permalink: /zips/
eleventyComputed:
  description: "Browse {{ groups.stats.laZips }} Los Angeles County ZIP codes, plus cards mailed from elsewhere, in the ArtCard archive."
---
<h1>Browse by ZIP code</h1>
<p class="lede">{{ groups.stats.laZips }} Los Angeles County ZIP codes, plus {{ groups.zips.length - groups.stats.laZips }} from elsewhere. Also see the <a href="{{ '/map/' | url }}">map</a>.</p>
<ul class="ziplist">
{%- for z in groups.zips %}{% if z.inLA %}
<li><a href="{{ ('/zip/' + z.zip + '/') | url }}"><b>{{ z.zip }}</b> <span>{% for n in z.neighborhoods %}{{ n.name }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}</span> <i>{{ z.items.length }}</i></a></li>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
</ul>
<h2>Outside Los Angeles County</h2>
<ul class="ziplist">
{%- for z in groups.zips %}{% if not z.inLA %}
<li><a href="{{ ('/zip/' + z.zip + '/') | url }}"><b>{{ z.zip }}</b> <span>{% for n in z.neighborhoods %}{{ n.name }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}</span> <i>{{ z.items.length }}</i></a></li>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
</ul>
<h2>No ZIP code</h2>
<ul class="ziplist">
{% for r in groups.regions %}<li><a href="{{ ('/region/' + r.slug + '/') | url }}"><b>{{ r.name }}</b> <i>{{ r.items.length }}</i></a></li>{% endfor %}
</ul>
